            "te": "మంగళ హారతి"
          },
          "instruction": {
            "en": "Offer camphor aarti singing Sukhkarta Dukhharta / Jai Ganesha.",
            "te": "కర్పూర మంగళ హారతి ఇవ్వండి."
          }
        },
        {
          "order": 11,
          "title": {
            "en": "Visarjan (on the final day)",
            "te": "నిమజ్జనం"
          },
          "instruction": {
            "en": "On the concluding day, offer a farewell puja and immerse the idol in water with respect, praying for an early return.",
